  "body": [
    "The AI-native media library built for marketing teams who can't afford a broken asset pipeline. From instant brand search to agentic campaign management — your entire content operation, finally under control.",
    "The moment a creative asset lands in Playbook, AI tags every image, video, and file across 16+ dimensions — visual style, color palette, campaign, product, talent, usage rights, and more. No more \"where's that hero shot from Q3?\"",
    "Playbook's AI extracts and categorizes metadata across every asset the moment it hits your library — integrated with Gemini, OpenAI, and Playbook's own production LLM. Marketing teams stop wasting hours hunting through Dropbox folders with cryptic filenames. Every asset is immediately discoverable, the way your team actually thinks about it.",
    "Powered by an agentic GPT search layer, Playbook understands creative and brand context — not just filenames and tags someone remembered to apply in 2022. Auto-clustering breaks results into categories that make sense for marketing workflows. Find the right visual for the right channel, right now.",
    "Playbook's infrastructure is optimized for creative file sizes. Bulk-upload an entire campaign shoot, download a client's final deliverable package, or sync your desktop folder — all without the spinner anxiety. And once assets are in, AI auto-tags them instantly so you're never starting from scratch.",
    "Stop emailing turntable videos and hoping reviewers can give useful feedback on a compressed proxy. With Miris integration, Playbook streams full-fidelity 3D product assets in your browser. Rotate, inspect finishes, and pin feedback to exact surfaces — from any device, anywhere.",
    "Marketing teams reviewing 3D packaging, product renders, or campaign assets have always suffered from fidelity loss in review. Playbook + Miris streams the actual asset — not a flattened video proxy — to any device. Your CMO on a phone, your agency partner on a tablet, your internal team on laptop all see the same full-fidelity model. No GPU infrastructure. No installs. No wasted revision rounds from miscommunication.",
    "Global campaigns ship through dozens of localizations, legal revisions, and channel adaptations. Playbook keeps every version intact — compare regional variants side-by-side, restore a prior approved cut, and maintain a complete compliance trail without a single spreadsheet.",
    "Built-in version stacking means every creative iteration lives inside the same asset — no more V_FINAL_v3_APPROVED_USE-THIS-ONE.jpg. Side-by-side comparison gives brand managers and legal teams the confidence to approve fast. The full edit history — who changed what, when, for which market — is tracked automatically. Your compliance team will sleep better.",
    "Enterprise marketing runs on brand governance and access control. Playbook's permission system keeps your internal team, regional offices, external agencies, and freelancers on exactly the right side of every asset boundary — with a full sign-in and access log for every action.",
    "Link multiple brand libraries under a single organization — global HQ, regional hubs, and campaign-specific workspaces each maintain their own structure within one coherent system. External agencies get scoped access to exactly what they need and nothing more. When a campaign ends or an agency relationship changes, you revoke access cleanly, completely, and instantly. No lingering permissions. No brand leaks.",
    "Playbook ships with a curated ecosystem of creative and post-production tools. Admin enables them once — every team member and collaborator gets access, no separate licenses or permission juggling required."
  ],
